  "what_this_resolves": {
    "the_C46_limitation": "C46 worried the finding might be about pathway granularity. Comparing pathways (38 levels) with target strings (86 levels) shows both beat identity in some pools (+2.42 and +2.17 in both_unseen) and neither decisively beats the other (the direct contrast is significant in 1 of 3 pools, favouring targets), so the signal is not an artefact of using a coarse annotation",
